| | **Practical Assistance** | Projects secondary content (stats/chat) on the wall; acts as ambient bias lighting [File: Master Fact Sheet]. | Adjusts screen brightness and color temperature to match media mood [File: Master Fact Sheet]. | Acts as a mobile cinema; adjusts height and angle for optimal viewing [File: Master Fact Sheet]. |
| **Moving Around the House** | **Seamless Presence** | **Stationary:** Rotates head (FOV 60°) to maintain eye contact as user walks past [File: Master Fact Sheet]. | Rotates the display to maintain "eye contact" as the user walks past [File: Master Fact Sheet]. | **Mobile:** Proactively moves out of the user's path; maintains "Crowded Zone" distance [File: Master Fact Sheet]. |
| | **Practical Assistance** | Projects directional light paths on the floor/wall to guide the user [File: Master Fact Sheet]. | Displays directional arrows or visual cues on-screen to assist navigation [File: Master Fact Sheet]. | Drives ahead of the user to physically lead them to a destination [File: Master Fact Sheet]. |

